I am working in Windows and I have followed the steps in http://rpy.sourceforge.net/rpy/README. I'm using R-2.10.1 so I have added C:\Program Files\R\R-2.10.1\bin to my path variable.

When I try
>>> from rpy import *
I get an error message:
Traceback (most recent call last):
